SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 AEDT: Screen Australia Future Leaders Delegation: Bi
 tSummit 2027 (Kyoto)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 05 Nov 2026 at 17:00 AEDT.\n\nScreen Australia's Future 
 Leaders Delegation sends up to eight early-to-mid career Australian gamema
 kers to BitSummit 2027 in Kyoto\, Japan (21-23 May 2027)\, one of Asia's l
 eading independent games festivals.\n\nOrganisation: Screen Australia\nLoc
 ation: Delegation to BitSummit 2027 in Kyoto\, Japan (21-23 May 2027)\, wi
 th a pre-departure workshop in Melbourne. Open to Australian citizens or p
 ermanent residents\, or incorporated Australian companies.\nAward: AUD 6\,
 000 per delegate towards flights\, accommodation\, event tickets\, ground 
 transportation and meals\, plus covered travel costs for the pre-departure
  workshop and the opportunity to exhibit a game on the Australia stand. Up
  to eight delegates.\nDuration: BitSummit runs 21-23 May 2027 in Kyoto\; m
 andatory pre-departure workshop in Melbourne in mid-April 2027\n\nMore: ht
 tps://www.screenaustralia.gov.au/fund/future-leaders-delegation-bitsummit-
 2027/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.screenaustralia.gov.au/fund/future-leaders-delegation-bitsu
 mmit-2027/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Delegation to BitSummit 2027 in Kyoto\, Japan (21-23 May 2027)\, w
 ith a pre-departure workshop in Melbourne. Open to Australian citizens or 
 permanent residents\, or incorporated Australian companies.
END:VEVENT
